ow:** `RcqView.tsx` no longer reads `useMetagameStatus` or the reset-based window. It passes `{ days: 14 }` to `useMetaPresence` and uses the new share note.\n- **Summed shares:** `expectedOptions` in `rcq.ts` now sums the share of every row for a key at the chosen tier. A key with several labels is named by the key itself.\n- **Long tail under \"Other\":** `rcq.ts` also gains `MAIN_SHARE` (0.02) and `splitOptions`. `InputsCard.tsx` shows the main chips, then any hidden-tail options you've picked, then the missing ones. A pill button after them reads `Other (N)` or `Fewer`.\n\nWhile the tail is expanded, the button stays as `Fewer` even if every tail option is picked, so you can still collapse it. The spec didn't say either way.", "ttft_ms": 2434, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 38830, "uuid": "003f6351-23d6-4c78-b1ea-8e823bbd0f0a", "ttft_stream_ms": 1733, "time_to_request_ms": 52, "first_content_frame_ms": 1733, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
